        "TileImage": "$($repository 5a3a3205-75d6-4cd9-b397-fee70e878601).Image",
        "Description": "Today in Paris there is a summer party, where a big cooking competition is being held. Our client is one of the participants in the cooking competition and is sure that he cannot beat his opponent and tonight&apos;s taget, Parisian super chef Olivier Lauzier. So our client wants you to murder Olivier in a way that looks like either an accident or poisoning. Also, no one can see you doing any suspicious action, because otherwise someone might notice that something is wrong. Good luck, and cooking.",
